@startuml
title BC01-C1 — Cartographie SI Actuel\nReal Estate Intelligence Platform

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "Business User" as BusinessUser
actor "Chasseur" as Hunter
actor "Platform / DevOps Engineer" as PlatformEngineer
actor "Data / AI Engineer" as DataEngineer

rectangle "Developer Workstation\nWindows 11 / VS Code" as Workstation

cloud "Internal DNS\n*.lab.local" as DNS
rectangle "NGINX Ingress\n+ cert-manager" as Ingress

package "Git / Delivery" {
  component "GitLab CE\nSource Repositories" as GitLab
  component "GitLab CI\nBuild / Test / Publish" as GitLabCI
  component "Container Registry\nGitLab Registry" as Registry
  component "GitOps Repository\nlab-gitops" as GitOpsRepo
  component "Argo CD\nContinuous Reconciliation" as ArgoCD
}

package "Kubernetes Platform\nkubeadm HA v1.30.14" {

  package "Real Estate Application\nnamespace: real-estate" {
    component "FastAPI Backend\n/api/v1" as API

    component "Authentication\nreal_estate.utilisateur\nArgon2id + JWT" as Auth

    component "Role-Based RBAC\nADMIN / CLIENT /\nCHASSEUR / SERVICE" as RBAC

    component "Business APIs\nclients\nmandats\ndemandes\nbiens\npresentations\nrecommendations\nvisites" as BusinessAPIs

    component "Deterministic Matching\nHard Eligibility\n+ Weighted Ranking" as Matching

    component "Application Audit\nreal_estate.audit_log" as Audit

    database "PostgreSQL\nreal_estate-postgresql" as PostgreSQL
  }

  package "Data Platform" {
    component "Airflow\nKubernetesExecutor" as Airflow
    component "dbt\nTransformations / Tests" as DBT
    component "OpenMetadata\nMetadata / Lineage /\nProfiling / Governance" as OpenMetadata
    component "MLflow\nExperiments / Tracking" as MLflow
  }

  package "Observability" {
    component "Prometheus" as Prometheus
    component "Alertmanager" as Alertmanager
    component "Grafana" as Grafana
    component "Loki" as Loki
    component "Tempo" as Tempo
    component "OpenTelemetry Collector" as OTEL
    component "Pushgateway" as Pushgateway
  }
}

package "PostgreSQL Logical Data Layers" {
  database "raw\nBronze" as Raw
  database "staging\nSilver" as Staging
  database "real_estate\nOLTP / Business" as OLTP
  database "warehouse\nGold" as Warehouse
  database "analytics\nMarts / Curated" as Analytics
  database "migration_control" as MigrationControl
}

cloud "External / Dedicated Storage" {
  component "MinIO\nBackup + ML Artifacts" as MinIO
}

node "Dedicated AI Host" as AIHost {
  component "NVIDIA GTX 1080\n8 GB VRAM" as GPU
  component "Ollama" as Ollama
  component "Qwen3 8B\nQuantized" as Qwen
}

note right of AIHost
Current capability:
local / experimental AI inference.

Not currently the production
Real Estate recommendation path.
end note

note right of Matching
Production recommendation path:

1. Deterministic hard eligibility
2. Eligible population
3. Weighted ranking
4. Recommendation
5. Presentation

ML does not silently replace
business eligibility rules.
end note

note bottom of OpenMetadata
Current:
metadata, lineage, profiling,
ownership, governance.

Not a lakehouse.
end note

note bottom of Auth
Current authentication is internal.

Keycloak / OIDC central IAM
remain target-state capabilities.
end note

note bottom of MinIO
Current verified recovery path:

PostgreSQL
  ->
logical backup
  ->
MinIO
  ->
isolated restore
  ->
integrity validation
end note

BusinessUser --> DNS
Hunter --> DNS
DNS --> Ingress
Ingress --> API

API --> Auth
Auth --> RBAC
RBAC --> BusinessAPIs

BusinessAPIs --> Matching
BusinessAPIs --> Audit
BusinessAPIs --> PostgreSQL
Matching --> PostgreSQL
Audit --> PostgreSQL

Workstation --> GitLab
PlatformEngineer --> GitLab
DataEngineer --> GitLab

GitLab --> GitLabCI
GitLabCI --> Registry
GitLabCI --> GitOpsRepo
GitOpsRepo --> ArgoCD
ArgoCD --> API
ArgoCD --> Airflow
ArgoCD --> OpenMetadata
ArgoCD --> MLflow

Airflow --> Raw
Airflow --> Staging
Airflow --> OLTP
Airflow --> DBT

DBT --> Staging
DBT --> Warehouse
DBT --> Analytics

PostgreSQL --> Raw
PostgreSQL --> Staging
PostgreSQL --> OLTP
PostgreSQL --> Warehouse
PostgreSQL --> Analytics
PostgreSQL --> MigrationControl

OpenMetadata --> PostgreSQL
OpenMetadata --> Airflow
OpenMetadata --> DBT

MLflow --> MinIO

PostgreSQL --> MinIO : scheduled backup

API --> Prometheus : /metrics
Airflow --> Prometheus
OpenMetadata --> Prometheus

API --> OTEL
OTEL --> Tempo

API --> Loki
Airflow --> Loki

Prometheus --> Alertmanager
Prometheus --> Grafana
Loki --> Grafana
Tempo --> Grafana
Pushgateway --> Prometheus

Ollama --> Qwen
Qwen --> GPU

DataEngineer --> MLflow
DataEngineer --> Ollama

note bottom
CURRENT-STATE CARTOGRAPHY

Included:
- Proxmox-backed Kubernetes platform
- GitLab CI / GitOps / Argo CD
- FastAPI business application
- internal JWT authentication + role RBAC
- deterministic recommendation path
- PostgreSQL OLTP + analytical layers
- Airflow + dbt
- OpenMetadata
- MLflow
- observability stack
- MinIO backup/artifact storage
- dedicated GTX 1080 / Ollama AI host

Not represented as current production capability:
- RAG
- MCP
- Qdrant
- Keycloak
- Vault workload integration
- Kafka
- Spark / Iceberg / Trino
- Databricks-style lakehouse
- React production frontend
- AI Gateway
- production GPU-trained Real Estate ranking model
end note

@enduml